		"en": [
			"• The \"Build Strike Galaxy Cosmos\" backpack that appears in episode 5 of \"Build Fighters Batlogue\" is now available on HGBC!",
			"• The Striker Pack system allows you to equip various Gunpla!",
			"• The biggest feature is that each of the 12 wings can move independently, creating a wide variety of silhouettes!",
